+| 监视器、轨道与工作区 | [项目源片全屏](../evidence/ai-production/round-1/director-webkit/source-fullscreen-narrow.png) · [调节后的剪辑布局](../evidence/ai-production/round-1/layout-chromium/arranged-workspace.png) · [窄屏检查器](../evidence/ai-production/round-1/layout-webkit/phone-viewer.png) |
